+- 匯出：`/opt/blenv/bin/python tools/blender/env_second/aa_support/komichi_interior.py -- --out <tmp>.glb`，再 `IN=<tmp>.glb bash tools/blender/env_second/lightbake/bake_gg_new.sh aa_komichi` 烘光照。
